'''Inland City''' (Japanese: '''クガシティ''' ''Kuga City'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Johto]], and the largest port city on [[Blue Point Isle]]. Located on the southern end of the island, it is known as the entry point to the [[Whirl Islands]]. [[Pokémon Trainer]]s can register for the [[Whirl Cup]] here. Off the shore of Inland City is the large blue rock from which Blue Point Isle takes its name. The [[Pokémon Center]] here has a large pool that connects to the sea.

